# P02 fixed Ruffle fixtures

These twelve complete fixture directories (including the original Hello World)
are copied without modification from
Ruffle tag v0.4.1, commit a1ac4ce8647352ad03044031cad0454a636427b8.
The project-authored manifest.json records every upstream path, source URL,
target path, size, SHA-256 and license. LICENSE_MIT and LICENSE_APACHE are the
unchanged licenses included in the pinned upstream distribution imported by P00.

The native runner defines its own explicit subsets and tolerances. Passing a
subset does not mean the entire upstream integration suite or all Flash content
is compatible. Original expected outputs, source, FLA, SWF and auxiliary files
remain complete. Runtime version and assets are unchanged.
